meta {
  name: Pairly API
}

headers {
  X-Pairly-Org: {{orgId}}
}

auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{apiKey}}
}

docs {
  Requests use the API key (apiKey) unless they say "person": those use a person's JWT (token) with orgId. People decide in Pairly; an API key can read, propose and upload, never approve.
}
